          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ikawa katika mwanzo wa mwaka mpya, wakati ambapo wafalme huenda vitani, Yoabu aliliongoza jeshi na kuteka nyara nchi ya Waamoni, pia akaenda na kuuzingira Raba. Lakini Daudi alibaki huko Yerusalemu. Naye Yoabu aliushambulia Raba na kuuharibu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye Daudi akaichukua taji ya mungu wao Milkomu kichwani pake; naye aligundua ya kwamba taji hiyo ilikuwa na uzito wa kilo thelathini na tano za dhahabu na ndani yake mlikuwemo kito cha thamani. Naye Daudi akakitwaa kupambia taji yake. Pia, aliteka idadi kubwa ya nyara kutoka katika mji huo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu aliwachukua watu wa mji huo, akawaweka wafanye kazi kwa misumeno, sururu za chuma na mashoka ya chuma. Hivyo ndivyo alivyoitenda miji yote ya Waamoni. Hatimaye Daudi na watu wote wakarudi Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
