        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulitokea tena vita na Wafilisti. Naye Elhanani mwana wa Yairi alimuua Lahmi nduguye Goliathi, Mgiti, ambaye mpini wa mkuki wake, ulikuwa kama mti wa mfumaji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadaye kulitokea tena vita huko Gathi ambako kulikuwa na mtu mmoja aliyekuwa na kimo kikubwa, na vidole sita katika kila mkono, na vidole sita katika kila mguu, jumla yake vidole ishirini na vinne. Yeye pia alikuwa mzawa wa majitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye alipowatukana Waisraeli, Yonathani, mwana wa Shimea, nduguye Daudi, alimuua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hao walikuwa wazawa wa majitu huko Gathi; nao waliuawa na Daudi pamoja na watumishi wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
